<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2415] Add an example of usage for CacheLoadOnlyStoreAdapter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2415</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is a high demand on the functionality provided by &lt;tt&gt;CacheLoadOnlyStoreAdapter&lt;/tt&gt; from the community.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&apos;s quite often needed to preload a cache from a read only storage that can be a DB, CSV or other file.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Definately it&apos;s time to add the example.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
